msgid "Revan event reconstruction"
msgstr "Revan 事件重建"

msgid ""
"``Revan`` runs native event reconstruction with a native configuration and optional geometry "
"override. Use ``working_space`` for an existing experiment/result, or ``sim_path`` with "
"``output_dir`` to start an experiment from an external event file. The native MEGAlib "
"installation must provide ``revan``; PyROOT is not imported."
msgstr ""
"``Revan`` 使用原生配置和可选 geometry 覆盖调用原生事件重建。使用 ``working_space`` 接续既有实验或结果；使用 ``sim_path`` 与 "
"``output_dir`` 从外部事件文件创建实验。MEGAlib 安装必须提供 ``revan``，本包不导入 PyROOT。"

msgid "Continue an existing simulation in a notebook"
msgstr "在 notebook 中接续既有模拟"

msgid "An existing Cosima execution directory can be used directly:"
msgstr "可直接使用既有 Cosima 执行目录："

msgid ""
"Both runtime modes from :doc:`cosima` are supported. Use ``Revan()`` when the current environment"
" is already initialized. Restart a notebook kernel after updating an editable installation, and "
"record the tested Git revision."
msgstr ""
"支持 :doc:`cosima` 中的两种 runtime。当前环境已初始化时可使用 ``Revan()``。更新 editable 安装后应重启 notebook kernel，并记录测试所用"
" Git revision。"

msgid ""
"Legacy Cosima directories remain readable and unchanged. To continue from one, supply a fresh "
"output_dir; new reconstruction records appear below ``revan/attempt-001/``. The native command is"
" equivalent to:"
msgstr "旧 Cosima 目录保持只读且不改动。接续时提供新的 output_dir；重建记录写入 ``revan/attempt-001/``。等效原生命令为："

msgid ""
"The explicit output argument prevents the native default of writing a tra next to the input event"
" file. Revan selects compression from the output suffix; ``compressed=False`` produces "
"``events.tra`` instead of ``events.tra.gz``."
msgstr ""
"显式输出参数防止原生工具默认将 TRA 写在输入事件文件旁。Revan 根据输出后缀选择压缩；``compressed=False`` 生成 ``events.tra``，否则为 "
"``events.tra.gz``。"

msgid "Configuration handling"
msgstr "配置处理"

msgid ""
"A main ``config_file`` is required when defining a new analysis, and belongs in the Revan "
"constructor. Python checks that the supplied configuration is a readable, nonempty file, archives"
" its bytes and passes an identical copy to native Revan with ``-c``. It does not parse XML, "
"inspect configuration fields, rename tags, rewrite values, or normalize formatting."
msgstr ""
"定义新分析时，必须在 Revan 构造函数传入主 ``config_file``。Python 检查它可读且非空，记录原始字节，并通过 ``-c`` 将相同内容传给 Revan。不解析 "
"XML、不检查字段、不重命名标签、不改值、不规范化格式。"

msgid ""
"MEGAlib uses its own XML-like format. Its writer and example files contain ``<SpectrumBefore)>``,"
" which standard XML parsers reject. Interpretation belongs to MEGAlib, including its handling of "
"unsupported fields or invalid files. Native software may diagnose an error or fall back to "
"defaults; passing a file explicitly is not a guarantee that every setting was accepted. Inspect "
"logs."
msgstr ""
"MEGAlib 使用自己的类 XML 格式。其 writer 和示例含标准 XML 解析器不能接受的 ``<SpectrumBefore)>``。配置解释、未知字段及无效文件的处理由 "
"MEGAlib 决定。原生程序可能报错，也可能回退默认值；显式传文件不能保证每项设置都被接受，请检查日志。"

msgid ""
"The manifest-recorded configuration preserves the original bytes, with identical SHA-256 "
"checksums. Comments, whitespace, line endings, unknown names and literal values are unchanged."
msgstr "manifest 保留原始配置字节及相同 SHA-256。注释、空白、换行、未知名称和字面值均保持不变。"

msgid ""
"The native child runs from the original configuration directory so relative resource paths retain"
" that base. ``geometry=None`` in a new definition omits ``-g``; Revan uses the geometry selected "
"by its configuration. A supplied geometry is forwarded unchanged with ``-g``, allowing native "
"override/path handling. Python does not open, validate, hash or archive geometry or other "
"external resources. MEGAlib and the caller control native configuration resources; event input "
"and output flags remain explicit."
msgstr ""
"原生子进程从原配置目录运行，以保留相对资源路径的基准。新定义中 ``geometry=None`` 省略 ``-g``，由 Revan 配置决定 geometry；非空 geometry "
"原样通过 ``-g`` 传递。Python 不打开、校验、hash 或归档 geometry 及其他外部资源。配置资源由 MEGAlib 与调用者管理，事件输入输出仍使用显式参数。"

msgid "Changing configuration"
msgstr "覆盖配置参数"

msgid "Pass arbitrary native setting paths as Python keyword arguments:"
msgstr "将任意原生参数路径写成 Python 关键字："

msgid "These produce repeated native options:"
msgstr "以上会生成重复的原生选项："

msgid ""
"Only keyword names have underscores replaced by dots. Values are separate argv items, preserving "
"spaces, underscores, equals signs and native variable syntax; booleans become ``true``/``false`` "
"and other values use ``str``. No setting whitelist, parameter-path discovery or value validation "
"is performed. Native Revan applies the overrides; the original configuration snapshot is "
"unchanged. Its CLI geometry/input/output precedence remains native behavior."
msgstr ""
"仅将关键字名称中的下划线替换为点。值作为独立 argv 项传递，保留空格、下划线、等号与原生变量语法；布尔值转成 ``true``/``false``，其他值使用 "
"``str``。不维护白名单、不发现参数路径、不校验参数值。原生 Revan 应用覆盖，原配置快照不变。geometry/input/output 的 CLI 优先级由原生程序决定。"

msgid ""
"For a constructor-bound definition, choose a new analysis_id for a different main file, resource "
"cwd, geometry or baseline overrides. task only labels a command; changing task does not redefine "
"the analysis. Method keyword changes are recorded per execution and leave the constructor "
"baseline intact."
msgstr ""
"已绑定构造定义时，不同主文件、资源 cwd、geometry 或基准覆盖要求新 analysis_id。task 只标记命令，改变 task "
"不会重定义分析。方法关键字覆盖逐次记录，不改变构造基准。"

msgid ""
"Repeated calls retain distinct execution IDs and do not overwrite products. Calls without an "
"analysis_id use the legacy numbered-group allocation. No automatic configuration optimization, "
"queueing or branch visualization is performed. See :doc:`workspaces` for selection and index "
"behavior."
msgstr "重复调用保留不同 execution ID，且不覆盖产物。省略 analysis_id 时沿用旧编号组分配。不自动优化配置、排队或绘制分支。选择与索引行为见 :doc:`workspaces`。"

msgid "Native settings isolation"
msgstr "隔离原生用户设置"

msgid ""
"Default execution retains the native HOME and normal settings behavior, including Revan's "
"reading/writing of ``~/.revan.cfg``. The wrapper does not rewrite configuration paths to "
"compensate for environment changes."
msgstr "默认保留原生 HOME 及正常设置行为，包括 Revan 对 ``~/.revan.cfg`` 的读写。本包不会为适应环境变化而重写配置资源路径。"

msgid ""
"``isolate_settings=True`` is an explicit opt-in: setup still runs with the original HOME, then "
"only the native tool receives a private HOME under ``logs/native-home``. Configuration bytes "
"remain unchanged, so HOME-based paths then use that private directory. The caller's environment "
"stays unchanged. The CLI equivalent is ``--isolate-settings``."
msgstr ""
"``isolate_settings=True`` 为显式选项：setup 使用原 HOME，之后仅原生工具使用 ``logs/native-home`` 下的私有 "
"HOME。配置字节不变，因此基于 HOME 的路径也指向新目录。调用者环境不变。CLI 对应 ``--isolate-settings``。"

msgid "Explicit inputs and multiple files"
msgstr "显式输入与多个文件"

msgid "A Cosima result with exactly one declared simulation file can be passed directly:"
msgstr "Cosima 结果只声明一个模拟文件时，可以直接传入："

msgid ""
"If a declared upstream group has multiple files, the adapter requires an explicit selection "
"instead of choosing a filename or modification time:"
msgstr "上游产物组包含多个文件时必须显式选择，不按文件名或修改时间猜测："

msgid ""
"Select the intended native entry file deliberately. A native file may itself reference "
"continuation/include files; Revan handles those references. The wrapper does not claim to merge "
"independently generated simulation shards, and it does not recursively archive native event-file "
"continuations."
msgstr "请有意识地选择原生入口文件。原生文件可能引用 continuation/include 文件，由 Revan 处理。本包不宣称合并独立模拟分片，也不递归归档事件 continuation 文件。"

msgid "External files and explicit destinations"
msgstr "外部文件与显式目标"

msgid "Use exactly one input entry point:"
msgstr "以下输入入口只能选一个："

msgid ""
"``working_space=...`` continues from an experiment/legacy Cosima directory, result object or "
"explicit upstream reference."
msgstr "``working_space=...`` 从实验根目录、旧 Cosima 目录、结果对象或显式上游引用接续。"

msgid ""
"``sim_path=...`` receives a standalone ``.sim``, ``.sim.gz``, ``.evta`` or ``.evta.gz`` file and "
"requires ``output_dir=...`` for the experiment root."
msgstr "``sim_path=...`` 接收独立 ``.sim``、``.sim.gz``、``.evta`` 或 ``.evta.gz``，必须用 ``output_dir=...`` 指定实验根。"

msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

msgid ""
"This creates an experiment index at ``experiments/received-grb/manifest.json`` and an attempt "
"below ``revan/attempt-001/``. ``output_dir`` is always an experiment root, not a single-execution"
" directory. The external event file stays in place; its contents are not read, copied or hashed "
"for provenance. Its path is registered as ``origin`` in the root manifest, with no invented "
"Cosima execution or upstream UUID."
msgstr ""
"在 ``experiments/received-grb/manifest.json`` 建立实验索引，并在 ``revan/attempt-001/`` "
"建立数据组。``output_dir`` 始终是实验根，不是单次执行目录。外部事件文件保留原位；来源记录不读取、复制或 hash 其内容。根 manifest 将真实路径登记为 "
"``origin``，不伪造 Cosima 执行或上游 UUID。"

msgid "Continue or branch within the new experiment through its recorded input:"
msgstr "通过登记的输入在新实验内继续执行或分支："

msgid ""
"Reusing the same external input and output root allocates another attempt; a different event-file"
" origin is rejected for an already established experiment. Existing experiments can optionally be"
" referenced into a new destination with ``working_space=..., output_dir=...``. There is no "
"separate destination ``workspace`` parameter. A workspace cannot combine a registered external "
"input with another Cosima origin. ``.tra`` files belong to the later analysis adapter."
msgstr ""
"复用同一外部输入和输出根会分配另一个 attempt；既有实验拒绝不同事件 origin。也可用 ``working_space=..., output_dir=...`` "
"将既有实验引用到新目标，没有独立的目标 ``workspace`` 参数。一个 workspace 不能将登记的外部输入与另一个 Cosima origin 混在一起。``.tra`` "
"由后续分析适配器处理。"

msgid "Records, failures and capture limits"
msgstr "记录、失败与捕获范围"

msgid ""
"Successful calls return ``ExecutionResult`` with ``outputs[\"tra\"]``, logs, execution ID, "
"manifest path and, for managed executions, ``workspace_dir``. The recorded upstream selection "
"contains the exact event path passed to ``-f``; same-workspace parents use ID links; selected "
"external records are snapshotted and hashed."
msgstr ""
"成功返回 ``ExecutionResult``，包含 ``outputs[\"tra\"]``、日志、execution ID、manifest 路径及受管理执行的 "
"``workspace_dir``。上游记录保留真正传给 ``-f`` 的事件路径；同 workspace 使用 ID 关联，选定外部记录会快照并计算 hash。"

msgid ""
"The manifest records the base configuration hashes, actual command flags, geometry argument (or "
"null when omitted), and ordered native setting overrides. External configuration resources are "
"not interpreted, checked or archived. File use and diagnostics belong to native MEGAlib and the "
"caller."
msgstr ""
"manifest 记录基准配置 hash、实际命令参数、geometry（省略时为 null）以及有序原生覆盖。不会解释、检查或归档外部配置资源；文件使用与诊断由原生 MEGAlib "
"和调用者负责。"

msgid ""
"Preparation, launch, native exit, timeout and missing nonempty output failures retain logs and "
"manifests through ``ExecutionError``. Workspace indexes retain failed attempts. Output checks are"
" operational only; no image, event content or scientific validation is performed by this adapter."
msgstr ""
"准备、启动、原生退出、超时或预期非空输出缺失等错误，通过 ``ExecutionError`` 保留日志和 "
"manifest。工作区索引保留失败执行。产物检查只验证执行状态，不验证图像、事件内容或科学正确性。"

msgid "Command-line example"
msgstr "命令行示例"

msgid ""
"Omit ``--setup-script`` for direct execution. For external data use ``--sim-path "
"received/events.sim.gz --output-dir experiments/received-grb``. The input flags are mutually "
"exclusive."
msgstr ""
"直接执行时省略 ``--setup-script``。外部数据使用 ``--sim-path received/events.sim.gz --output-dir experiments"
"/received-grb``，输入参数互斥。"

msgid "Current workspace layout"
msgstr "当前工作区布局"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`workspaces` for the authoritative data-oriented layout. Revan calls use "
"``revan/<analysis_id>`` when bound, or numbered ``revan/attempt-NNN`` groups when unbound, "
"without a task directory level. The task label remains queryable metadata. All executions are "
"stored in the root manifest; use ``result.record`` to read one command by execution ID. Mimrec "
"may reuse the selected reconstructed data across extraction and analysis."
msgstr ""
"准确的数据导向布局见 :doc:`workspaces`。绑定后使用 ``revan/<analysis_id>``，未绑定时为 ``revan/attempt-NNN``，均没有 task "
"目录层。task 仍是可查询元数据。所有执行存于根 manifest，通过 ``result.record`` 按 execution ID 读取单条。Mimrec "
"可在提取和分析中复用选定重建数据。"

msgid "Compact recording"
msgstr "精简记录"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`workspaces` for the default manifest-based source/config retention, temporary native "
"inputs and launch helpers, optional archival mode and keyword-based summary capture. Empty logs "
"are removed and their result paths are None. A physical configuration snapshot is retained only "
"when runtime.archive_inputs is true."
msgstr ""
"默认 manifest 内 source/cfg 保留、临时原生输入与启动文件、可选归档及关键词摘要见 :doc:`workspaces`。空日志删除，结果路径为 None。仅 "
"runtime.archive_inputs 为 true 时保留实体配置快照。"

msgid "Named reconstruction analyses"
msgstr "命名重建分析"

msgid ""
"Bind the experiment root, analysis_id and main configuration when constructing Revan. "
"MEGAlibRuntime controls process startup; it does not own analysis settings."
msgstr "构造 Revan 时绑定实验根、analysis_id 和主配置。MEGAlibRuntime 只控制进程启动，不持有分析设置。"

msgid ""
"The directory is revan/reconstruction-a. Construction freezes the cfg bytes, resource cwd, "
"literal geometry and baseline native -C text without starting a process or creating workspace "
"files. Configuration remains opaque. Repeated calls retain separate execution IDs and non-"
"overwriting products."
msgstr ""
"目录为 revan/reconstruction-a。构造冻结 cfg 字节、资源 cwd、字面 geometry 与基准原生 -C 文本，不启动进程也不创建文件。配置始终作为 opaque "
"原生输入。重复调用拥有独立 execution ID，产物不会覆盖。"

msgid "Individual native overrides affect one command only:"
msgstr "单次原生覆盖仅影响该命令："

msgid ""
"Use actual setting names supported by your native Revan version. Baseline and execution overrides"
" are separately recorded in the root manifest. The first execution's temporary settings do not "
"become group defaults. Different main cfg bytes/resource cwd, geometry or constructor baseline "
"overrides require another analysis_id. A different sim/evta entry also requires another analysis "
"ID. Native fields, paths and values are never parsed or validated by Python."
msgstr ""
"请使用自己 Revan 版本支持的真实参数名。根 manifest 分别记录 baseline 与 execution overrides。首次执行的临时参数不会成为组默认。不同主 cfg "
"字节/资源 cwd、geometry、构造覆盖或 sim/evta 入口要求不同 analysis_id。Python 不解析或校验原生字段、路径和值。"

msgid ""
"The original method-level config_file/geometry entry remains available for legacy groups without "
"a bound definition. Those groups retain warning-and-variant semantics. Reopening with constructor"
" settings opts into a fixed definition; its baseline must match the group's saved defaults. A "
"legacy method call cannot bypass an existing bound definition. The main example above is "
"recommended for new analyses."
msgstr ""
"无绑定定义的旧组仍支持方法级 config_file/geometry，并保留 warning 和变体语义。通过构造设置重开即选择固定定义，基准必须与保存的 defaults "
"一致。旧方法入口不能绕过已有绑定。新分析推荐使用上述构造绑定方式。"

msgid ""
"Mimrec can select this parent through revan_analysis_id. Its own analysis_id may be different, "
"enabling several selection/imaging branches per reconstruction. See :doc:`workspaces` for the "
"distinction between analysis_id, task and execution_id."
msgstr ""
"Mimrec 可用 revan_analysis_id 选择这个父节点；其自身 analysis_id 可不同，从而实现一个重建对应多个筛选/成像分支。analysis_id、task 与 "
"execution_id 的区别见 :doc:`workspaces`。"

msgid ""
"For a failed analysis whose entire directory has been removed, the same analysis_id can accept "
"corrected constructor settings when all recorded executions failed. Old failures remain in the "
"manifest; the next command recreates the layout and records the new baseline. See "
":doc:`workspaces` (\"Recover a removed failed analysis\") for the precise recovery conditions. "
"Successful or in-progress analyses keep their definition protection."
msgstr ""
"仅当组内全部执行失败且用户已删除整个组目录时，同一 analysis_id 才可接受修正后的构造设置。旧失败记录保留；下次执行重建目录并记录新基准。完整条件见 :doc:`workspaces`"
" 的失败分析恢复章节。成功或在途分析仍受定义保护。"
